  "description": "High-performance Redis client for .NET: RESP2/RESP3, all Redis 2.8-7.x data structures and commands, message queues, cluster, sentinel and cloud adapters. 高性能Redis客户端：支持RESP2/RESP3、Redis 2.8～7.x全部数据结构与命令、消息队列、集群、哨兵与云厂商适配。",
